bin/
obj/
.vs/
*.user

# Simulation output
out/
*.jsonl
*.log

# A sealed baseline is an archive, not output. *.jsonl and *.log above would
# otherwise silently drop world-42.jsonl and world-42.log from every baseline --
# the same way they left out/ untracked until the artefacts were force-added --
# and a baseline missing two of its ten files still looks complete on disk.
!baselines/**
